        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructive Yacht-Inspired Deck-Building Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll an avalanche of dice to craft classic Yacht hands and trigger explosive synergies that send your score through the roof!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must land as many hands as possible within a limited number of rolls each stage, stacking up points to beat the target score. Spend your hard-earned coins on powerful items to turbocharge your progress and break every limit.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Yacht Hands</strong><br>Full House, Straight, Yacht… instantly familiar combos that reward you in a flash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building &amp; Shop</strong><br>Customize your strategy: choose the right items after each stage to tailor your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong><br>Target scores climb with every level—retry endlessly and chase your personal best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergistic Power</strong><br>Fuse items and rare cards for skyrocketing score multipliers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to pick up, impossible to put down: the perfect blend of thrilling chance and deep strategy. Hear the dice clatter and watch your numbers explode—experience the ultimate numerical rush!</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice</strong><br><strong>Dicee</strong><br><strong>Diceee</strong><br><strong>Diceeee</strong><br>Diceeeee <br>Diceeeeee <br>Diceeeeeee...</p>",
